  --- the verdict ---
  DNA v66 BOUNDS THE WALK. Cycle-start F1 sd falls past 3 SE against the
  same jaw ungated, and the per-cycle range does not collapse with it --
  the two halves the pre-registration required. The jaw cycle is now a
  boundary for F1 and not only for volume. Read it NARROWLY: this is a
  structural property of the decoder, and whether anything can USE the
  boundary is the next question, not this one.
